{"name":"Firewatch","hex":"#ee8866","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Firewatch","blocks":[{"text":"Firewatch is a 2016 adventure game developed by Campo Santo and published by the developer in partnership with Panic. The game was released in February 2016 for Linux, OS X, PlayStation 4, Windows, followed by Xbox One in September 2016, and Nintendo Switch in December 2018. The story follows a fire lookout named Henry who works in Shoshone National Forest in Wyoming. Henry interacts with his supervisor Delilah using a walkie-talkie, choosing what to say from dialogue options, and developing his relationship with her. Over the course of the summer, Henry and Delilah are menaced by unseen forces and have to unravel a years-old mystery."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a5/Firewatch_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Firewatch"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/0e/Firewatch_gameplay.png/330px-Firewatch_gameplay.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/0e/Firewatch_gameplay.png/330px-Firewatch_gameplay.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Henry interacts with Delilah using his walkie-talkie.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFirewatch_gameplay.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Game_Developers_Conference_2017%2C_IGF_GDC_Awards_066_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Game_Developers_Conference_2017%2C_IGF_GDC_Awards_066_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Game_Developers_Conference_2017%2C_IGF_GDC_Awards_066_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-Game_Developers_Conference_2017%2C_IGF_GDC_Awards_066_%28cropped%29.jpg?